5,1,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! Let's make sure we don't just guess the fees this year. We need real data so we know exactly what we can count on for the budget!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. A thoughtful approach is best. We should look at both the finances and how people are actually using the club lately.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We can't just look at money. Some people do all the work while others barely show up. We need to see who's actually here.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I think we should also consider the administrative side. We need a system that is sustainable for whoever manages the books.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm in! Let's make sure we look at how new people join too. I want everyone to feel welcome, no matter when they start!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Exactly! @Toshio, if we check the ledger and bank statements, we can stop the guesswork and find a stable figure.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, looking at the attendance records might reveal why some members seem hesitant to join us these days.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,Right. I want to see the sign-in sheets and the rota. I'm tired of the same few people doing everything.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I'll focus on the workload. I want to see the treasurer's logged hours and the minute books from previous years.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the taster evening forms and the mid-year sign-ups! I want to see why some people don't end up joining.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,Sounds like a plan! I'll take the financial records to see where we stand.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the weekday turnout and the winter social notes to understand the current atmosphere.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Takumi,,Fine. I'll handle the attendance and the rota. Let's see how uneven things really are.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. I'll investigate the administrative burden to ensure we don't burn out the next treasurer.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,Awesome! I'll find out about the newcomers. Let's make sure the fees don't scare them away!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
